    "name": "Effect: Freezing Shield",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Freezing Shield].</p><p>A dome of frozen air surrounds you for 1 minute. You and your allies inside gain cold resistance and a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against ranged attacks. Ranged and spell attacks crossing into the dome from outside take a &minus;4 circumstance penalty.</p><p>Any creature hostile to you that enters the dome or ends its turn inside it takes cold damage with a basic Fortitude save, and is slowed 1 on a failure.</p>"
        },
